msgid "About RAM on {0}"
msgstr "关于 {0} 上的 RAM"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/ram/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"RAM is the on-chain storage of the {0} network. Every account, token balance,\n"
"and smart contract table occupies RAM, and an account must hold enough of it to store the data its\n"
"actions create."
msgstr ""
"RAM 是 {0} 网络上的链上存储空间。每个账户、代币余额和智能合约表都会占用 RAM，\n"
"账户必须持有足够的 RAM，才能存储其操作创建的数据。"

#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/ram/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"RAM is bought from and sold back to a system-managed market whose price moves with demand, so it\n"
"trades like a token and is measured in kilobytes. This page shows the current price per\n"
"kilobyte, the market capitalization, and the total supply, and lets a signed-in account buy or\n"
"sell RAM directly from the market. The calculator converts between token amounts and bytes at\n"
"the current price."
msgstr ""
"RAM 从系统管理的市场中购买，也可卖回该市场，其价格会随需求变化，因此 RAM 像代币一样交易，并以千字节计量。此页面显示每千字节的当前价格、\n"
"市值和总供应量，并允许已登录的账户直接从市场购买或出售 RAM。计算器会根据当前价格在代币数量和字节数之间进行换算。"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/staking/+page.svelte
msgid "About staking on {0}"
msgstr "关于在 {0} 上进行质押"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.systemToken?.symbol.name
#. placeholder {1}: data.network.chain .name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/staking/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Staking locks {0} tokens in the {1} system contract in exchange for a share of the network's staking rewards. Rewards are distributed\n"
"continuously in proportion to each account's staked balance, and the rate shown as APR changes as\n"
"the total amount staked changes."
msgstr ""
"质押会将 {0} 代币锁定在 {1} 系统合约中，以换取网络质押奖励的一部分。奖励会根据每个账户的质押余额持续按比例分配，\n"
"显示为年利率（APR）的奖励率会随质押总量变化而变化。"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/staking/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Staked tokens can be unstaked at any time. They then pass through a lockup period before they\n"
"can be withdrawn back to a liquid balance. Unicove lets you stake, unstake, and withdraw from\n"
"this page with any {0} compatible wallet, and shows the balance held in each\n"
"stage for the signed-in account."
msgstr ""
"已质押的代币可以随时解除质押。之后，它们会经历一段锁定期，才能提取回流动余额。Unicove 允许你在此页面使用任何兼容 {0} 的钱包进行质押、\n"
"解除质押和提取，并显示已登录账户在每个阶段持有的余额。"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/swap/+page.svelte
msgid "About swaps on {0}"
msgstr "关于在 {0} 上进行兑换"

#. placeholder {0}: context .network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/swap/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Swaps on Unicove exchange one token for another through contracts that run on the {0} network itself, with no third-party exchange involved. The swaps listed here\n"
"come from the network's system contracts, including the RAM market, wrapped tokens, and token migrations\n"
"where a network has replaced its native token."
msgstr ""
"Unicove 上的兑换通过运行在 {0} 网络本身上的合约，将一种代币兑换为另一种代币，不涉及第三方交易所。此处列出的兑换来自网络的系统合约，\n"
"包括 RAM 市场、封装代币，以及网络替换其原生代币时进行的代币迁移。"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(account)/swap/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Each swap shows its current rate before you sign, and the transaction settles on chain in a\n"
"single action. Connect a {0} compatible wallet to swap from your own account."
msgstr "每次兑换都会在你签名之前显示当前汇率，交易也会通过一次操作在链上完成结算。连接兼容 {0} 的钱包，即可从自己的账户进行兑换。"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/network/+page.svelte
msgid "About the {0} network"
msgstr "关于 {0} 网络"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/network/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"{0} is a public blockchain built on the Antelope protocol. Blocks are produced\n"
"by a rotating set of elected block producers, and a block becomes irreversible once enough of them\n"
"have confirmed it."
msgstr ""
"{0} 是基于 Antelope 协议构建的公有区块链。区块由一组轮换产生的当选区块生产者生成，\n"
"当足够多的区块生产者确认某个区块后，该区块便不可逆。"

#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/network/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"This page reads the live state of the chain: the current head block, the last irreversible\n"
"block, the producer signing blocks right now, and the software version the API node reports.\n"
"Where the network publishes activity statistics, charts of actions, transactions, and account\n"
"growth appear over selectable time windows."
msgstr ""
"此页面读取链的实时状态：当前头区块、最后一个不可逆区块、正在签署区块的生产者，以及 API 节点报告的软件版本。\n"
"在网络发布活动统计数据的情况下，还会按可选时间范围显示操作、交易和账户增长图表。"

#. placeholder {0}: data.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/network/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Unicove is a block explorer and web wallet for {0}. Every account,\n"
"transaction, block, and contract on the network can be searched from here."
msgstr ""
"Unicove 是用于 {0} 的区块浏览器和网页钱包。你可以在此搜索网络上的每个账户、\n"
"交易、区块和合约。"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/producers/+page.svelte
msgid "About block producers on {0}"
msgstr "关于 {0} 上的区块生产者"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/producers/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Block producers are the validators of the {0} network. Token holders elect\n"
"them by voting with staked tokens, and the top-ranked producers take turns producing blocks and confirming\n"
"the chain."
msgstr "区块生产者是 {0} 网络的验证者。代币持有者通过使用已质押的代币投票选出他们，排名靠前的生产者轮流生成区块并确认链。"

#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/producers/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Voting power is proportional to the amount staked. An account can vote for several producers at\n"
"once or delegate its vote to a proxy. This page lists producers by rank with their vote totals\n"
"and lets a signed-in account cast or update its votes. Rankings update as votes change, so the\n"
"list reflects the current state of the election."
msgstr ""
"投票权与质押数量成正比。一个账户可以一次为多个生产者投票，也可以将投票委托给代理。此页面按排名列出生产者及其总票数，\n"
"并允许已登录的账户投票或更新投票。排名会随着票数变化而更新，因此列表反映选举的当前状态。"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/token/+page.svelte
msgid "About tokens on {0}"
msgstr "关于 {0} 上的代币"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/token/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"Tokens on the {0} network are issued by smart contracts, and each is identified\n"
"by the issuing contract together with its symbol. The network's native token is issued by the system\n"
"contract, and RAM is tracked as a token in the same way."
msgstr ""
"{0} 网络上的代币由智能合约发行，每种代币都通过发行合约及其符号进行标识。网络的原生代币由系统合约发行，\n"
"RAM 也以同样的方式作为代币进行追踪。"

#. placeholder {0}: context.network.chain.name
#: src/routes/[[locale]]/[network]/(explorer)/token/+page.svelte
msgid ""
"This directory lists the tokens Unicove tracks on {0}, with the issuing\n"
"contract, the current price where a price feed exists, and holder counts where a holder index is\n"
"available. Open a token to see its supply, holders, and recent activity, or search for any\n"
"account to see the tokens it holds."
msgstr ""
"此目录列出 Unicove 在 {0} 上追踪的代币，包括发行合约、存在价格数据源时的当前价格，以及存在持有者索引时的持有者数量。\n"
"打开某种代币可查看其供应量、持有者和近期活动，或搜索任意账户以查看其持有的代币。"

